## 5b. Known context (do not re-check; use directly)

Cross-project facts already settled live in the reader `SKILL.md` and `references/` (the always-on Platform basics, plus the on-demand references). When writing a doc, **cite** them; do **not** re-verify them for every project. Facts that are specific to {{ identity.display_name }} and belong in this section are kept in `{{ names.local_rules }}.md` under "Known context (§5b)".

