## 8. Process cheat sheet

1. Confirm the repo path (under `{{ paths.repos_root }}`); say which repos you will search before a cross-project search; set the owner per §6.
2. Sweep the repo with an Explore agent per the §4 table (with file:line).
{{#if has.live_tools}}
3. Verify with the §5 live tools ({{ lists.live_checks }}).
{{else}}
3. Verify from code only (§5: no live tool is configured).
{{/if}}
4. Draft in English, apply the template, obey the §6 hard rules and the local rules.
5. Update `references/project/index.md` (or the domain `index.md`).
6. A fact that repeats across projects → lift it into a shared layer (§2).
7. Show the diff; commit only after the user confirms.

